# Aunt Laura’S Spicy Chicken Dip

{ rating="5" image="aunt_lauras_spicy_chicken_dip.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] 1 large can [chicken]{ ing="chicken" }
- [ ] 1 cup [Frank’s Red Hot Sauce]{ ing="frank-s-red-hot-sauce" }
- [ ] 8 oz block [cream cheese]{ ing="cream-cheese" }
- [ ] 1/2 cup [ranch dressing]{ ing="ranch-dressing" }
- [ ] 1/4 cup [cheddar cheese]{ ing="cheddar-cheese" }

## Recipe

1. Heat [chicken]{ ing="chicken" } and franks until hot
1. Stir in [cream cheese]{ ing="cream-cheese" } and ranch
1. Mix in 1/2 of [cheese]{ ing="cheddar-cheese" } and use the rest on top
1. Broil to heat thoroughly
